{
	"name": "Hamstring",
	"type": "maneuver",
	"img": "icons/weapons/daggers/knife-green.webp",
	"system": {
		"description": "<p>A swift cut along the back of the knee, or ankle, can severely hamper an enemy’s ability to move or even stand. As a reaction to making a successful attack with a slashing weapon, you can force your target to make a Constitution saving throw. On a failed save, their movement speed is reduced to half. A successful medicine check against your combat maneuver DC as an action, or any amount of magical healing, ends this effect. Otherwise, it lasts until your target’s next long rest.</p>",
